# Sentinel gate-check: notes-snapshot.json is a per-run "last observed" cache,
# not a durable decision, so it's local-only. baseline.json IS committed
# (not ignored) — it records the deliberate "these violations were already
# known when the check went blocking" decision, and a fresh clone needs it
# to avoid immediately blocking on the pre-existing backlog.
sentinel-gate/notes-snapshot.json